==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Urs & Fenrir (Enemy)|Urs & Fenrir]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns.
**1 [[Croakley]] spawns.
**1 [[Loris]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**4 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take out the initial wave of Ragin' Gories and Doge Darks using a nuker such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. After that, using [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] to hit the base can chain the first Mr. Puffington, eliminating him from the fight instantaneously. After Mr. Puffington is dead, just try to kill the Ragin' Gories as quickly as possible; at this point, the majority of enemies left will be Relic (excluding Croakley), meaning [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Storm Beast Naala]] and [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]] function excellently at eliminating them quickly.

Once Urs & Fenrir bite the dust, the cleanup phase should not be too much of an issue.

